{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q416716","formula":"C₃₆H₅₆O₈","hill":"C36H56O8","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":36.0,"H":56.0,"O":8.0},"names":{"en":"12-O-tetradecanoylphorbol-13-acetate","ru":"12-O-тетрадеканоилфорбол-13-ацетат"},"descriptions":{"en":"12-O-Tetradecanoylphorbol-13-acetate (TPA), also commonly known as tetradecanoylphorbol acetate, tetradecanoyl phorbol acetate, and phorbol 12-myristate 13-acetate (PMA) is a diester of phorbol. It is a potent tumor promoter often employed in biomedical research to activate the signal transduction enzyme protein kinase C (PKC). The effects of TPA on PKC result from its similarity to one of the natural activators of classic PKC isoforms, diacylglycerol.","ru":"12-O-Тетрадеканоилфорбол-13-ацетат (ТФА), также известный как форбол-12-миристат-13-ацетат (ФМА) или тетрадеканоилфорбол ацетат (ТФА) — органическое соединение, сложный эфир форбола и карбоновых кислот, относящееся к группе форболовых эфиров. Является мощным промотором опухолей и широко используется в биомедицинских исследованиях для активации протеинкиназы C (PKC)."},"fame":12,"pubchemCid":27924,"mass":616.8,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCCCCCCCCCCCCC(=O)O[C@@H]1[C@H]([C@]2([C@@H](C=C(C[C@]3([C@H]2C=C(C3=O)C)O)CO)[C@H]4[C@@]1(C4(C)C)OC(=O)C)O)C","inchikey":"PHEDXBVPIONUQT-RGYGYFBISA-N","iupac":"[(1S,2S,6R,10S,11R,13S,14R,15R)-13-acetyloxy-1,6-dihydroxy-8-(hydroxymethyl)-4,12,12,15-tetramethyl-5-oxo-14-tetracyclo[8.5.0.02,6.011,13]pentadeca-3,8-dienyl] tetradecanoate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"27924","atoms":100,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":8.66,"y":-3.677,"z":-2.93,"el":"C"},{"x":7.919,"y":-3.397,"z":-1.631,"el":"C"},{"x":6.997,"y":-2.185,"z":-1.766,"el":"C"},{"x":6.147,"y":-1.926,"z":-0.519,"el":"C"},{"x":6.926,